IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BIDM.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT IDM-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-IDM-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS IDM-TXN-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-IDM-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IDM-FILE.
01 IDM-REC.
   05 IDM-TXN-ID PIC X(24).
   05 IDM-OPERATION PIC X(12).
   05 IDM-STATUS PIC X(01).
   05 IDM-RESULT PIC X(120).
   05 IDM-CREATED PIC 9(14).
   05 IDM-FP PIC X(16).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IDM-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-IDM-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKIDMP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-IDM-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-IDM-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/idm.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-IDM-PATH
    OPEN I-O IDM-FILE
    IF WS-IDM-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT IDM-FILE
        CLOSE IDM-FILE
        OPEN I-O IDM-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-IDM-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-IDM-ST TO BK-IDM-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE BK-IDM-MODE
        WHEN "B" PERFORM BEGIN-OP
        WHEN "G" PERFORM GET-OP
        WHEN "C" PERFORM COMPLETE-OP
        WHEN "F" PERFORM FAIL-OP
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "99" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE IDM-FILE
    GOBACK.

BEGIN-OP.
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE BK-IDM-TXN-ID TO IDM-TXN-ID
    MOVE BK-IDM-OPERATION TO IDM-OPERATION
    MOVE "R" TO IDM-STATUS
    MOVE SPACES TO IDM-RESULT
    MOVE BK-IDM-FINGERPRINT TO IDM-FP
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO IDM-CREATED
    WRITE IDM-REC
        INVALID KEY MOVE "22" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
    END-WRITE.

GET-OP.
    MOVE BK-IDM-TXN-ID TO IDM-TXN-ID
    READ IDM-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-IDM-ST
        WHEN "00"
            MOVE IDM-OPERATION TO BK-IDM-OPERATION
            MOVE IDM-STATUS TO BK-IDM-STATUS
            MOVE IDM-RESULT TO BK-IDM-RESULT
            MOVE IDM-FP TO BK-IDM-FINGERPRINT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "23" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE.

COMPLETE-OP.
    MOVE BK-IDM-TXN-ID TO IDM-TXN-ID
    READ IDM-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-IDM-ST
        WHEN "00"
            MOVE "C" TO IDM-STATUS
            MOVE BK-IDM-RESULT TO IDM-RESULT
            REWRITE IDM-REC
            MOVE "00" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "23" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE.

FAIL-OP.
    MOVE BK-IDM-TXN-ID TO IDM-TXN-ID
    READ IDM-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-IDM-ST
        WHEN "00"
            MOVE "F" TO IDM-STATUS
            MOVE BK-IDM-RESULT TO IDM-RESULT
            REWRITE IDM-REC
            MOVE "00" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "23" TO BK-IDM-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE.
